From de31cbbc03f62d60ea6e722ac9800ed78edc66c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:12:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui-kit): a camcraft-ui-kit crate for the design
 system

New crate crates/ui-kit (camcraft-ui-kit), egui and serde_json only.
It holds the theme token table, the camcraft-theme/1 reader and the
contrast checks, moved from camcraft-ui without a behaviour change, and
a gallery page (plus the ui-kit-gallery window behind the `gallery`
feature) that shows every token of the dark and the light theme.

camcraft-ui re-exports the old module paths, so no other code changes.
The live theme cell and the ThemeRef map stay in camcraft-ui. The four
contrast tests move to the kit; four seam tests keep the camcraft-ui
test count. The gate's crate lists name ui-kit (xtask, process file).
Decision: docs/decisions/4394-ui-kit-crate.md.

Fixes #4394

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
